description: "Radical idea generation with Arch Linux pragmatism and strict learning enforcement"
globs: ["**/*brainstorm*", "**/*plan*", "**/*planning*", "**/*architecture*", "**/*design*", "**/*ideate*", "**/*idea*", "**/*concept*", "**/*strategy*", "**/*strategic*", "**/*blueprint*", "**/*outline*", "**/*sketch*", "**/*draft*", "**/*proposal*", "**/*propose*"]
